  "bodyTemplate": "REIMBURSEMENT FORM\nSoftware Subscription — requests reimbursement for an out-of-pocket business cost.\nEmployee Name: {{subject_name}}         Date: {{date}}\nDepartment: {{department}}              Amount: {{amount}}\nCategory: {{category}}\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n{{details}}\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nApprover: {{approver_name}}\n\nSignature: {{signature}}"
